      "message": "So I tried to have Start/Stop in DeviceBase and StartImpl/StartImpl in backends. Unfortunately, at least where Start needs to be called in metal, it seems like it can only be called from the backend, which kind of defeats the purpose of adding it to DeviceBase.\n\nSo, for now, I just put the env reading code in DeviceBase and use it from the Metal backend.\n\nHappy to change it if you have better ideas.",
